                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "846627c6-4acc-3f8b-85f5-0a90aab58792",
                        "entry_id": "1c595a83-7106-3926-9c70-613b26dae7d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным марионетка; исполняемый с участием марионеток"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "210d3e1f-7093-3f05-bd50-9eb2c0428810",
                        "entry_id": "1c595a83-7106-3926-9c70-613b26dae7d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. подчиняющийся чужой воле, являющийся послушным орудием в чьих-либо руках"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae24c4d7-a73b-4018-a1ba-1674d9289b73",
                                "sense_id": "210d3e1f-7093-3f05-bd50-9eb2c0428810",
                                "text": "Гитлер, которому очень хотелось сделать какой-нибудь приятный жест в сторону Англии, предложил создать марионеточное польское микрогосударство по обеим сторонам демаркационной линии, разделяющей советские и немецкие войска."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c06decbd-85c2-4a4b-838f-c04d1b7aeb59",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c595a83-7106-3926-9c70-613b26dae7d3",
                        "source_sense_description": "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным марионетка",
                        "target_lang_word": "puppet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "puppet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2314a869-f111-307c-aae3-87f64274dd5c",
                                        "entry_id": "dc632a7a-59d7-3886-b3be-6f83a3944d21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any small model of a person or animal able to be moved by strings or rods, or in the form of a glove."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f164e35-ec43-3bb0-999d-3be6354a1263",
                                        "entry_id": "dc632a7a-59d7-3886-b3be-6f83a3944d21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person, country, etc, controlled by another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e3bd1c9-4281-4189-afe8-f33a634f211c",
                                                "sense_id": "6f164e35-ec43-3bb0-999d-3be6354a1263",
                                                "text": "These men , from no worse motive that could be discovered than a thirst after knowledge beyond their sphere , committed burglary upon the barn in which the puppets had been consigned to repose"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84e0bae5-c5e1-41d4-8609-64c8bd0986a8",
                                                "sense_id": "6f164e35-ec43-3bb0-999d-3be6354a1263",
                                                "text": "Every act of a Roman, from birth to death, from dawn to night, was controlled and supervised by some presiding deity. Man was thus virtually a symbolic puppet in the hands of the Roman pantheon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4233337-f5ec-382e-bc66-bf8a5d43c471",
                                        "entry_id": "dc632a7a-59d7-3886-b3be-6f83a3944d21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A poppet; a small image in the human form; a doll."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53906212-7950-365b-9eca-5b27b69707bc",
                                        "entry_id": "dc632a7a-59d7-3886-b3be-6f83a3944d21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The upright support for the bearing of the spindle in a lathe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
